guarantee: AC-2: non-English fixed language is decoded
file: crates/voicen-whisper/src/lib.rs
added_by: test-writer
--- old
Some(whisper_rs::get_lang_str(id).ok_or(FailureReason::LocalEngineFailed)?)
--- new
Some(whisper_rs::get_lang_str(id).filter(|c| *c == "en").ok_or(FailureReason::LocalEngineFailed)?)
--- end
